      "side": 1,
      "message": "Vadim, this extension is not called from USB, ever, and should never be. It\u0027s the call from the TPM/SPI path to the fw_upgrade_command_handler, where the USB call is on line 410 of this file. See: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/board/cr50/tpm2/upgrade.c\n\nI agree that this command encapsulation is exceedingly hard to reason about.  One more reason it should not be exposed publicly on secure systems.",
